OL,3,GNEWSACrown court judge warns students
OL,4,Aabout knife crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crown court judge has visited a
OL,7,Fschool to speak to students about the
OL,8,Fconsequences of carrying a knife.
OL,10,FJudge Caroline Wigin, who sits at Luton
OL,11,FCrown Court, gave a talk to Year 9 and
OL,12,FYear 10 students at Queensbury Academy
OL,13,Fin Dunstable, Bedfordshire.
OL,15,FShe said it was "terribly sad" that
OL,16,Fknife crime was increasing year by
OL,17,Fyear, with younger people being
OL,18,Finvolved.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
