OL,3,GNEWSACrown court judge warns students
OL,4,Aabout knife crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe hoped that as a result of her talk
OL,7,F"if just two young people went home and
OL,8,Ftook the knife out of their bag, I
OL,9,Fwould be delighted".
